<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Word of Recall</h1>
<p>Sphere: Summoning Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 10)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>cast word of recall</a>   (on yourself only)
</pre>
<p>Takes you home: to your hometown, or the temple of Udgaard if you have no 
other. The magic builds up for about half a minute first. Tiny blue 
sparks spring from your head, the air grows thick with magic, and then you 
vanish in a cloud of blue sparks.
</p><p>It fails if you die before it's done, or if you are somewhere magic can't 
take you out of. You must be standing to cast it, so it is no help in the 
middle of a fight: flee first. It is also found on staffs and scrolls.
</p><p>To take your followers home with you, see <a cmd='#'>Help Total Recall</a>.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Total Recall</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Summoning Sphere</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Fleeing</a>
</pre>




</div>